OL,3,GNEWSA'Our son donating organs means he
OL,4,Ais still around'
OL,5,
OL,6,FClaire Elliott said: "It's helped us
OL,7,Fmassively knowing that George was able
OL,8,Fto benefit so many people, even after
OL,9,Fhe died...it means George's life wasn't
OL,10,Fwasted."
